sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Layer
    participant Q as Query Optimizer
    participant I as Index (AXIS)
    participant S as Storage Engine
    participant R as Result Merger
    
    C->>A: Search Request
    A->>Q: Parse & Optimize
    Q->>Q: Select Strategy
    
    alt Index Available
        Q->>I: Query Index
        I->>I: Find Candidates
        I->>S: Fetch Vectors
    else No Index
        Q->>S: Scan Storage
    end
    
    S->>R: Return Results
    R->>R: Merge & Rank
    R->>A: Top-K Results
    A->>C: Response